        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko natwe, ko dukikijwe n’igipfungu c’ivyabona kingana girtyo, twiyambure ibituremēra vyose, n’icaha gikunda kutwizingirako vuba, dusiganirwe ivyo twashizwe imbere twihanganye, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.1",
