          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni co gituma, kuko twākīra ubgami budashobora kunyiganyizwa, dukwiye gukenguruka, kugira ngo tubone ingene dukorera Imana tuyihimbaye, tuyubaha tuyitinya: ",
          "type": "text",
